# GD-2 (round 19): L §3.1 `monthday`: "A day of the year without its year (13 April). `02-29` is no month-day ...
# (refused, `LOAD-PARSE`). Month-days compare with `==` and `!=` only; any order or arithmetic on them is refused (§8.4)."
# An order in an ask line (`file_by <= 05-01`, the literal allowed there, L §7.1): LOAD-UNIT (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index yrs = year 2026..2027
input file_by: monthday
input other: monthday


version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  file_by = 04-30
  other = 04-30
ask q: file_by <= 05-01
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT an order orders month-days: they compare with == and != only (m.tally:20)
